    limitations under the License.

As required by Section 4 of that License, this is a statement of changes: the
model has been reimplemented in PyTorch, a compiled and CUDA-graph-captured
inference path has been added along with its presets and the `--fast`,
`--preset`, `--group_size` and `--batch_size` options, the per-task evaluation
scripts have been consolidated into a single generation script, and the
training loop and data pipeline have been reimplemented. Several upstream
behaviours are reproduced deliberately rather than corrected; these are
documented at their call sites.


